WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.370
How's everybody doing tonight?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.706
Yeah, that's great to hear.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:08.774
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:10.643
President Biden said
yesterday that

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.913
the U.S. economic recovery
is going to take some time.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:18.284
Okay, "take some time," like the
Amazon option that saves you

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.487
a dollar or "take some time"
like "Avatar 2"?

00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:25.258
If he were any more vague,
he'd be a magic eight ball.

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.593
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.928
President Biden said for the
third time yesterday

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.164
that the U.S.
would respond militarily

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.132
if China tries to invade Taiwan.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:35.768
Well, at least he's capable
of taking a firm stand

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.470
on problems we don't have yet.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.072
Yeah, yeah, we'll fight China!

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:41.107
Student loans?

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.244
Uh, yeah, let me call
some people.

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:47.080
In her new memoir, ex-Trump
adviser Kellyanne Conway

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.948
acknowledges that former
President Trump

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.516
lost the 2020 election.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:52.852
I know.
I was surprised, too.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.155
However, she does say he lost
to William Howard Taft.

00:00:56.155 --> 00:01:00.493
She just can't -- can't help
but get one lie in there.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.429
According to a new report,
ex-Trump attorney Michael Cohen

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:06.465
said in a recent deposition that
former President Trump was

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:12.104
afraid of getting pied in the
face by demonstrators.

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:14.974
I don't know. That feels
like some reverse psychology.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.109
[ Imitating Donald Trump ]
"You know what?

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.676
You know what would
totally own me?

00:01:17.676 --> 00:01:19.946
If someone threw an entire

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.648
freshly baked pie
right in my face.

00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:24.584
Even worse, if it had some
of that cinnamon

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:25.885
crumble stuff on top of it.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.821
If they also hit me
with a side of whipped cream,

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:31.023
oh, I would be so delicious --

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:34.226
I mean, embarrassed."

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:36.396
[ Normal voice ] A guitar played
by the late Kurt Cobain

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:39.866
sold in an auction over the
weekend for nearly $5 million.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:41.634
It's the perfect way to say,

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.170
"I don't get what he was
singing about."

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.573
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.973 --> 00:01:51.277
That's working at home
with some step-dads right now.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:54.781
That joke's landing with some
step-dads right now at home,

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.482
and I'm willing to suffer
through this moment

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.618
with you guys.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.953
But I see you.

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:03.288
[ Whispering ] Step-dads.

00:02:03.288 --> 00:02:05.692
Step-dads, I see you.

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:08.495
Sorry about everybody here.
They're doing their own thing.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.833
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.302
[ Normal voice ] The fast food
chain Arby's announced yesterday

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.304
that it will add
a hamburger to its menu

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.739
for the first time
in its history,

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:22.508
but people don't go to Arby's
because they want a burger.

00:02:22.508 --> 00:02:25.078
They go there because everything
else is closed.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:28.047
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.449
Bruce Springsteen
&amp; The E Street Band announced

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:32.184
today that they'll go on
tour next year

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:33.753
after a six-year hiatus.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.488
Though, just to be safe, they're
gonna put a sneeze guard

00:02:36.488 --> 00:02:37.924
between Bruce and Stevie.

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.226
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:41.361
[Whispering ] Step-dads.

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.896
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:47.066
I don't know why I tried to do
two for you in the same show.

00:02:52.037 --> 00:02:54.373
[ Normal voice ] Firefighters in
New Jersey recently removed

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:56.909
a four-foot Monitor lizard
from a tree

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:58.177
in a residential neighborhood.

00:02:58.177 --> 00:02:59.612
Isn't that wild?

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.748
There's a tree in New Jersey.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:04.984
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:07.887
Don't shake your head, Wally.

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:11.357
Our cue card, New Jersey's Wally
over on cue cards is like,

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:12.792
"Ohh, trees."

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:15.161
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.598 --> 00:03:21.800
It's just very distracting
to read cue cards when you're

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.102
scoffing at the punchline.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.903
-I have two trees in my yard.
-What did you say?

00:03:24.903 --> 00:03:26.172
-I have two trees
in my own yard.

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:28.707
-Two trees? Well!

00:03:28.707 --> 00:03:30.643
Ol' two-tree Wally.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.745
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:38.051
Are you gonna go to Wally's
two-tree summer party?

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.286
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.787 --> 00:03:44.590
And finally, New York City
yesterday removed its last

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.158
public payphone from service.

00:03:46.158 --> 00:03:48.428
But don't worry,
anywhere else in New York

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.563
will still be a public restroom.

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:53.232
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:53.232 --> 00:03:56.703
We've got a great show
for you tonight.

